# SPA fallback for Netlify — REQUIRED, and the equivalent of the rewrite block
# in .htaccess (which is Apache-only and ignored by Netlify entirely).
#
# React Router owns /about, /expressions, /gallery, /expression/<slug> etc.
# None exist as files, so without this every deep link and page refresh 404s.
#
# Netlify matches real static files BEFORE applying this rule, so assets,
# images and the favicon still serve normally. The 200 (rather than 301/302)
# keeps the URL in the address bar while serving index.html.
/*  /index.html  200
